### All events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events

### Search
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?q=game

### One event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/2

### Event that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/999

### Create an event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pierogi workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "Student kitchen",
  "capacity": 15
}

### Invalid event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "date": "tomorrow", "capacity": -5 }

### Update event 4
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/events/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pierogi workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "Student kitchen",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Delete event 4
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/4

### Delete event 4
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/999

### Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stats

### Delete event 1 (for the empty test)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/1

### Delete event 2 (for the empty test)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/2

### Delete event 3 (for the empty test)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/3

### Stats with no events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stats

### Date in the past -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Old event",
  "date": "2025-05-01T10:00",
  "location": "Room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

### Title longer than 120 characters -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This title is far too long for an event. It just keeps going and going because I want to check that the server rejects any title that has more than one hundred and twenty characters, so it has to fail",
  "date": "2026-12-10T10:00",
  "location": "Room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

### Location longer than 100 characters -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Long location",
  "date": "2026-12-10T10:00",
  "location": "Building A, second floor, the small room at the end of the long corridor, right next to the vending machine",
  "capacity": 10
}

### Description longer than 1000 characters -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Long description",
  "date": "2026-12-10T10:00",
  "location": "Room 1",
  "description": "This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long. This description is much too long.",
  "capacity": 10
}

### Two rules broken at once (200-character title + past date) -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This title is far too long for an event. It just keeps going and going because I want to check that the server rejects any title that has more than one hundred and twenty characters, so it has to fail",
  "date": "2025-05-01T10:00",
  "location": "Room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

### From a date
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?from=2026-11-01

### From a date (same day counts)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?from=2026-10-22

### Sort by title
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?sort=title

### Search + sort
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?q=night&sort=title

### q, from and sort together
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?q=a&from=2026-10-20&sort=title

### Invalid from -> 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?from=yesterday